OL,3,GNEWSAFour teenagers seriously injured
OL,4,Ain crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour teenagers have been seriously
OL,7,Finjured in a crash in North Yorkshire.
OL,9,FIt happened on Coldhill Lane, in
OL,10,FSherburn-in-Elmet, at about 02:50 BST
OL,11,Fon Saturday and involved a red SEAT
OL,12,FIbiza. No other vehicles were involved,
OL,13,Fsaid police.
OL,15,FThe injured, all occupants of the car,
OL,16,Fincluded three 17-year-olds and an
OL,17,F18-year-old.
OL,19,FNorth Yorkshire Police said officers
OL,20,Fare keen to trace the driver of a white
OL,21,Fpick-up truck who may have seen the
OL,22,FSEAT prior to the crash.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
